      "description": "hidden pool variant explore-fast-2: slot 2. Its model is NOT set here -- plugins/agent-pool.ts injects it from pool-models.json at config time, so that file is the only place the pool models live. Spawn 'explore-fast' and let the pool route.",
      "mode": "subagent",
